Preserve all previously approved constraints, including:
- existing dashboard jobs remain unchanged
- namespace/RBAC limitations
- no node/HPA/PVC/cluster-wide analytics
- maintenance-window restart handling
- no unsupported dependency/root-cause claims
- raw observations remain preserved
- existing API/dashboard compatibility

Do not stop after Phase 0/1. Continue through Phase 7 unless you encounter a genuine architectural blocker.

